    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1e\ud83c\udf19 Il Sole e la Luna 2 \u2013 A New Epic Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Following the events of the first chapter, Sunny has achieved his dream of becoming a Royal Guard, while Moony has chosen to step away from the spotlight. However, a year later, a dark threat emerges within the seemingly impregnable walls of the Kingdom of Town's capital. The two heroes must reunite to confront a mystery that could alter the fate of the realm.Steam Store+2Steam Store+2Steam Store+2</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong>: Engage in strategic battles with spectacular animations and unique settings.SteamDB+3Steam Store+3Steam Store+3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open World Exploration</strong>: Freely explore a vast kingdom filled with secrets, side quests, and hidden locations.Steam Store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Progression</strong>: Level up, equip a wide array of weapons and armor, and learn new skills and magic through a revamped system.Steam Store+1Steam Store+1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Side Quests</strong>: Over 50 side quests that enrich the storyline and offer unique rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounty Hunting</strong>: Defeat and capture dangerous enemies scattered across the kingdom.Steam Store+2Steam Store+2Steam Store+2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Content</strong>: Discover new playable characters, face challenges in the post-game Colosseum, and much more.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae Additional Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Genre</strong>: RPG, Adventure, Strategy, IndieSteam Store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Modes</strong>: Single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Languages Supported</strong>: English, ItalianSteam Store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Release Date</strong>: November 3, 2019</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Developer/Publisher</strong>: UNGame ProductorSteamDB+8Steam Store+8Steam Store+8</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Sunny and Moony in this new adventure to save the kingdom once again! Prepare for an unforgettable experience in the world of <strong>Il Sole e la Luna 2</strong>.</p>",
